--- /dev/null
+++ b/site/src/content/docs/status/partition-limit-exceeded.mdx
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+---
+title: PartitionLimitExceeded
+status: unfixable
+description: Dependency is split into more partitions than its version group allows
+---
+
+import SeverityUnfixable from "@partials/severity/unfixable.mdx";
+
+## When this happens
+
+- ✓ Instance is in a version group with a `partitionBy` and a `maxPartitions`
+- ✘ Its dependency is divided into more partitions than `maxPartitions` allows
+- ? We cannot know which of those partitions you meant to keep
+
+Every instance of the dependency is reported, including any which could not be
+partitioned, and each keeps its own specifier.
+
+## Severity
+
+<SeverityUnfixable />
