@@ -35,6 +35,52 @@ Require all dependencies in this group to use the highest semver version found o
 
 <Packages />
 
+### partitionBy <Badge text="Optional" variant="note" />
+
+Divide this group's instances before a preferred version is elected, so that each partition elects
+its own. Instances in different partitions are never compared, which lets a monorepo hold more than
+one major of a dependency on purpose.
+
+Set it to `major`, `minor`, `releaseChannel`, or a list of semver ranges which each instance is
+sorted into by the first range it satisfies.
+
+```json title=".syncpackrc.json"
+{
+  "versionGroups": [
+    {
+      "dependencies": ["zod"],
+      "partitionBy": "major"
+    }
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+An instance whose specifier has no version to compare, such as `workspace:*` or a tag, is not
+partitioned. Those instances stay grouped under the dependency's own name and are reported after all
+of its partitions. The same applies under `minor` to a specifier which pins only a major, such as
+`^1`, because it names no single minor.
+
+`syncpack json` reports each instance's partition under `partition`, and `syncpack list` gives each
+partition its own row headed by the dependency name and the partition key, such as `zod 3`.
+
+### maxPartitions <Badge text="Optional" variant="note" />
+
+The most partitions any one dependency in this group may be divided into. A dependency over that
+limit is reported as [PartitionLimitExceeded](STATUS_PARTITION_LIMIT_EXCEEDED) and is not resolved
+automatically. Instances which could not be partitioned do not count towards the limit.
+
+```json title=".syncpackrc.json"
+{
+  "versionGroups": [
+    {
+      "dependencies": ["zod"],
+      "partitionBy": "major",
+      "maxPartitions": 2
+    }
+  ]
+}
+```
+
 ### severity <Badge text="Optional" variant="note" />
 
 <SeverityGroupSection group="highestSemver">
